---
/**
 * /explore/plans/build/ - consolidated into the builder card on the hub
 * (2026-09-19).
 *
 * This page ran the facet search RPC directly. The builder card on
 * /explore/plans/ now answers the same question against the same taxonomy,
 * without a network round trip, so keeping a second planner alive would
 * have split the surface and the maintenance.
 *
 * Retiring it was safe on the evidence: the URL ledger records it as an
 * orphan (zero internal inbound links) and the GSC indexing exclusions
 * audit of 13 August 2026 already listed it as a utility page that should
 * be noindex. The `consolidate` flag emits a canonical without noindex,
 * which is the strongest consolidation signal GitHub Pages can serve.
 *
 * The RPC layer itself is untouched in lib/, ready for the day the builder
 * expands past plans into venues and experiences.
 */
import Redirect from '../../../components/Redirect.astro';
---
<Redirect to="/explore/plans/#build" consolidate />
